      "id": "claim_347794b754514e73bc35701f1c522cc7",
      "statement": "The .pre-commit-config.yaml defines hooks for YAML/TOML validation, file ending/whitespace normalization, per-package format and lint execution via make, and version consistency checks across langchain-core, langchain-v1, and partner packages. Hooks prevent commits that fail linting or have formatting issues.",
