    {
      "id": "claim_c0f5ca806f244a4498fd5648746de4b6",
      "statement": "Each package's uv.lock pins exact dependency versions for reproducible builds. Lock files are regenerated via uv lock and verified with uv lock --check. The libs/ Makefile provides make lock (regenerate all) and make check-lock (verify all are up-to-date). UV_FROZEN=true in Makefiles prevents accidental lock changes during uv sync.",
      "evidence": [
